From 899c781d88a929d882133ab189aefaf6884a3db6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lance-index-build <lance-index-build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:13:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bench(index): standalone IVF_RQ stage benchmark for kernel
 arms

The stages binary runs each IVF_RQ build stage through the Lance function
the builder calls for it (train_kmeans, RabitQuantizer::build,
PreparedAssignment, ResidualTransform + RQTransformer) plus the query
probe (kmeans_find_partitions_arrow_array), on an in-memory GIST or BIGANN
base with no dataset or index writes. One process per kernel arm;
CENTROIDS_FROM / REF_DIR reuse a reference arm's centroids and compare
assignments row by row.
---
